, DBR Therapy, Equine-Assisted EMDR Therapy, EMDR Consultation, DBR Consultation, Therapy Intensives, including Equine-Assisted EMDR Intensives, DBR Intensives, EMDR Intensives, Structural Dissociation Theory Training and Consultation. US and UK. Training Calendar You might be feeling stuck, blocked, overwhelmed, anxious, or triggered. Perhaps you, or even your therapist, feel “stalled out” as if there’s some kind of “plateau\" happening. I understand that we can encounter impasses, feel stuck, or hit plateaus in our counseling journey. Sometimes, we may not know where to seek additional help. However, surprisingly, we might just need some additional clinical support to find relief.My name is Sarah Jenkins, LPC, CPsychol, and that’s my specialty. Maybe this is even familiar to you.... Perhaps you’ve “done a lot of work,” but still feel triggered and conflicted in relationships, or even feel anxious and overwhelmed when it’s not always clear “why.” There might be aspects of your day-to-day life that you wish were less distressing for you—things that you think “shouldn’t be a big deal,” but still are. I get it.Healing trauma can feel overwhelming. You just want to feel better. Period. For the last twenty+ years, I’ve specialized in the treatment of complex trauma and dissociation. My clinical work, training, and consultation practice is especially focused on helping therapists and their clients to increase their capacity to work with and heal complex trauma and dissociation. In addition to individual and group case consultations and trainings, I also provide adjunct EA-EMDR intensives and DBR intensive services \n公开联系片段：\n页面原文: Email Sarah\nHTML href: mailto:sarah@dragonflyinternationaltherapy.com","contentHash":"a46f4710cdf3e1078bea1ee18fa57c05de7a41ca64c3687e8064b708ebd49873","contentType":"text/html; charset=UTF-8","depth":0,"sourceKind":"website","retrievals":[{"requestedUrl":"https://dragonflyinternationaltherapy.com/","observedAt":"2026-09-17T04:25:15.675Z"}]},{"id":"web:1868cfcfc7e2ae6b9e4d9b3c","requestedUrl":"https://dragonflyinternationaltherapy.com/about/","finalUrl":"https://dragonflyinternationaltherapy.com/about/","observedAt":"2026-09-17T04:25:21.633Z","title":"About Sarah Jenkins - Dragonfly International Therapy","excerpt":"Skip to content 2026 Training Calendar Now OPEN! Trainings EMDR Therapy Training Equine-Assisted EMDR Training Structural Dissociation Training DBR Trainings Consultations Intensives Equine-Assisted EMDR Intensives DBR Intensives Modalities EMDR Equine-Assisted EMDR Structural Dissociation Theory Deep Brain Reorienting Yoga Resources About Blog In the News EquiLateral™ Shop Trainings EMDR Therapy Training Equine-Assisted EMDR Training Structural Dissociation Training DBR Trainings Consultations Intensives Equine-Assisted EMDR Intensives DBR Intensives Modalities EMDR Equine-Assisted EMDR Structural Dissociation Theory Deep Brain Reorienting Yoga Resources About Blog In the News EquiLateral™ Shop Student Log In About Sarah Jenkins I am an EMDRIA Approved EMDR Trainer and Consultant, and the creator of EquiLateral® aka EquiLateral: The Equine Assisted EMDR Protocol® I am also credentialed as a Chartered Psychologist (CPsychol) by the British Psychological Society, and am licensed in Arizona, where my private practice is located. I provide consultation and training, both in and outside of the US, for those providing complex trauma and dissociation treatment, including via EMDR therapy, Structural Dissociation Theory, EA-EMDR, and DBR therapy. Endorsed by Dr. Frank Corrigan, the creator of DBR therapy, as a DBR Consultant, I also receive ongoing consultation on my DBR consulting services directly from him. A trauma and dissociation specialist, EMDR therapist for over twenty+ years, and lifelong horsewoman, I created EquiLateral® for integrating EMDR and Equine-Assisted Therapy to become Equine-Assisted EMDR (EA-EMDR). Based on the success of this EA-EMDR protocol I offer EMDRIA-approved workshops and an EMDRIA Approved best practice training EquiLateral®: The Equine-Assisted EMDR Course for EMDR Therapists & Equine Professionals. In addition, through my experience in both EMDR and Equine Assisted Therapy, I offer support for those EMDR therapists seeking to expand their skills in utilizing strategies from the perspective of animal-assisted EMDR Therapy and DBR approaches, especially in their work with complex clients, as well as the utilization of animal-assisted interactions in EMDR Therapy and DBR therapy, to address attachment shock. Providing ongoing consultation for those seeking to increase their confidence in utilizing EMDR therapy with complex cases, my \n公开联系片段：\n页面原文: Email Sarah\nHTML href: mailto:sarah@dragonflyinternationaltherapy.com","contentHash":"ef9f5cd306ea24b17f5b73155ef1afd9f2efc441eeb2113260a96a9882669110","contentType":"text/html; charset=UTF-8","depth":1,"sourceKind":"website","retrievals":[{"requestedUrl":"https://dragonflyinternationaltherapy.com/about/","observedAt":"2026-09-17T04:25:21.633Z"}]},{"id":"web:6c8a8a36166860dc0f546554","requestedUrl":"https://dragonflyinternationaltherapy.com/contact","finalUrl":"https://dragonflyinternationaltherapy.com/contact/","observedAt":"2026-09-17T04:25:24.583Z","title":"Contact Sarah Jenkins - Dragonfly International Therapy","excerpt":"Skip to content 2026 Training Calendar Now OPEN! Trainings EMDR Therapy Training Equine-Assisted EMDR Training Structural Dissociation Training DBR Trainings Consultations Intensives Equine-Assisted EMDR Intensives DBR Intensives Modalities EMDR Equine-Assisted EMDR Structural Dissociation Theory Deep Brain Reorienting Yoga Resources About Blog In the News EquiLateral™ Shop Trainings EMDR Therapy Training Equine-Assisted EMDR Training Structural Dissociation Training DBR Trainings Consultations Intensives Equine-Assisted EMDR Intensives DBR Intensives Modalities EMDR Equine-Assisted EMDR Structural Dissociation Theory Deep Brain Reorienting Yoga Resources Abou